r contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py tests/unit/commands/test_compact_plan.py tests/unit/commands/test_lifecycle_cascade.py tests/unit/commands/test_replacement_walker.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/unit/commands/test_close_disposition.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/commands/test_compact_plan.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/commands/test_lifecycle_cascade.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/unit/commands/test_replacement_walker.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","ae4d-df34-480d-4c88"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"ae4d-df34-480d-4c88","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"89eb-b9dc-6f1b-4b4c","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/unit/commands","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["6f6f1896-0bd8-45b0-9263-5be399bbd7c8","89b402c9-2b34-4275-8dc1-610dee8192a3","1f90fc66